      <!-- REFERENCE DATASET TABLE 2: ASTM Volumetric Glassware Tolerances -->
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 2.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        Class-A vs. Class-B Volumetric Flask Tolerances (ASTM E288 / ISO 1042)
      </h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Maximum permissible volumetric uncertainties calibrated strictly at 20°C:
